  "_colorNote": "The swatch photo decides the family shown; these name tokens supply a SECOND searchable family when the two disagree (mill colour names are poetry — 'Meadow' is sage, 'Persimmon' is a grey medallion). Longest token wins. See familyFromRgb() in build-fabric-catalog.mjs for the photo side.",
