  "_patternNote": "Checked against patternName, then book, then additionalNotes. Unmatched rows fall back to the repeat field + the swatch photo's texture metrics: no repeat and a flat photo => Solid, no repeat but visible structure => Texture, a repeat with no keyword => Print.",
  "patternFallback": "Print",
